; Operators.
;
; Everything that transforms an existing source, plus the synth, video and
; visualisation operators. The top of the engine: it may see every other
; layer, and nothing may see it.
;
; liquidsoap_core_operators.mli lists what this library exports. A module that is
; not in it is private to this directory.

(library
 (name liquidsoap_core_operators)
 (flags
  (:standard
